invariant: INV-37
file: Makefile
catches: test/pinned-checkers.sh
reason: lint-cppcheck stops checking that its cppcheck is the pinned
  version. A catch script runs lint-cppcheck alone, without
  lint-toolchain, which does not read cppcheck's version either, so any
  cppcheck on PATH gives the verdict. test/pinned-checkers.sh hands
  lint-cppcheck an older and a newer stand-in and requires it to stop on
  the pin.

--- old
	$(call REQUIRE_PINNED,lint-cppcheck,$(CPPCHECK),^Cppcheck $(subst .,\.,$(CPPCHECK_VERSION))$$,Cppcheck $(CPPCHECK_VERSION))
--- new
